roximation of the function $f$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x,y) & ≈f(0,-1)+∇f(0,-1)\\cdot ⟨x,y+1⟩ \\\\  & ≈1+⟨0,-1⟩\\cdot ⟨x,y+1⟩ \\\\  & ≈1+0-(y+1) \\\\  & ≈-y.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535171 true] [17592186335340 1000 #edb/ref 17592186335341 13194139535171 true] [17592186335340 1000 #edb/ref 17592186335342 13194139535171 true] [17592186335340 1000 #edb/ref 17592186335343 13194139535171 true] [17592186335340 1000 #edb/ref 17592186335344 13194139535171 true] [17592186335340 1000 #edb/ref 17592186335345 13194139535171 true] [17592186335340 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535171 true] [17592186335340 1041 "selection" 13194139535171 true] [17592186335340 1104 #edb/ref 17592186335344 13194139535171 true] [17592186335340 1110 #uuid "6f44053c-e3ea-57ef-afec-69433ac1aedc" 13194139535171 true] [17592186335341 1034 "f(x,y)≈2x-y" 13194139535171 true] [17592186335341 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535171 true] [17592186335341 1111 #uuid "b51da9b3-6e88-5545-abc4-45af5f0f8d02" 13194139535171 true] [17592186335342 1034 "f(x,y)≈3+x+2y" 13194139535171 true] [17592186335342 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535171 true] [17592186335342 1111 #uuid "9fd93e11-34fe-5258-a98c-c04cb19edd05" 13194139535171 true] [17592186335343 1034 "f(x,y)≈-1+2x-2y" 13194139535171 true] [17592186335343 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535171 true] [17592186335343 1111 #uuid "aee2d835-0f14-5e37-9876-9a7116035ab1" 13194139535171 true] [17592186335344 1034 "f(x,y)≈-y" 13194139535171 true] [17592186335344 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535171 true] [17592186335344 1111 #uuid "59317a5c-7921-5b6a-a2c3-fe2d37f0e672" 13194139535171 true] [17592186335345 1034 "f(x,y)≈1-2x" 13194139535171 true] [17592186335345 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535171 true] [17592186335345 1111 #uuid "e07dd800-fc5b-565a-a99c-e5302be13a8e" 13194139535171 true] [17592186335346 1017 #edb/ref 17592186335347 13194139535171 true] [17592186335346 1089 "q-98325" 13194139535171 true] [17592186335346 1091 #edb/re